We can now design:

🎨 Visual design system (colors, typography, motion)

🧩 View DSL (how developers define views)

⚡ Client runtime architecture (very critical)

📦 App distribution model (replacement for web + app store)

This is where it becomes not just conceptual—but buildable and differentiated.


